& [WhyThisSeam]
  + the published proposal now provides the content-addressed object an operator could approve or reject
  + the production broker already distinguishes a supplied operator-authorization form but its retained evidence is fixture-only and no governed live operator key policy exists
  + detached verification is needed before a future authorization can be authenticated but signature integrity alone cannot establish that a key policy is legitimate current unrevoked or sufficient
